  "changes": [
    "Read compiled Draw/Look, Ramp/face-down mana, targeted removal/sweep, shield burn and Fly spell lock to identify compatible construction routes. Preserve established dedicated counter scoring.",
    "Introduce high-cost Revolution Change cards only with at least6 reachable matching sources; introduced copy count cannot exceed source count/2. Conditional Crystal Soul/GZero sources retain at least8 face-down mana enablers. New simple evolutions require enough matching bases; complex/dynamic conditions remain conservative and the engine retains actual legality.",
    "Reward only newly introduced copies, so an existing revolution-heavy seed does not gain an artificial scoring advantage. Keep original8 seeds/28 candidates/6 rounds/12 removal-row search caps. Cache identical route conditions per seed, reuse counts per round and evaluate opening features once per card ID. Defer compiled role walks until a route or seed support needs them.",
    "Recognize an available opposing ShieldMove685-to-grave choice in native mode scoring: Bolmomo chooses shield burn against an empty/too-large opposing board and sweep against multiple small enemies. No zone movement or card abilities changed.",
    "Regenerate only stale derived CPU builds using build version2. Existing decks/history/save format,9500 definitions and IDs, old unpublished verification items and stopped registration preserved."
  ],
